:: d6 [map littlemoose]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around->d6: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Visit the Mergimal Challenge Vending Machine.->d6: vending machine]]</li>
      <li>[[Talk to the big fellow near the vending machine.->hank]]</li>
      <li>[[Check out Veil School->d6: veil school]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'd6'>><<n>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'd6'>>
</div>

:: d6: description
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <img class='concept' src='images/story/littlemoose.png'>
  <div>
    <p>Littlemoose is a sleepy town, nestled in a tall forest. It is the home of the Veil School and its leader, Grace.</p>
    <p>The path to the north leads out of the town and into Littlemoose forest. A dirt path to the west is blocked by a heavy iron gate.</p>
    <p>A Mergimal Challenge Vending machine is here, where you can spend your hard-earned challenge coins. A big guy is pounding on the side of the machine.</p>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Keep exploring the village.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

:: d6: vending machine [vend littlemoose]
<<include 'littlemoose: vending machine'>>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Look around Littlemoose.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>

:: d6: veil school
<<if not $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.includes('closed')>>
  <p>As you approach the building, something doesn't seem right.</p>
  <p>There are no lights on inside and a hastily written sign is taped across the front doors.</p>
  <p>You step closer for a better look.</p>
  <p>The sign says: "temporarily closed. went to help blue urf. - grace"</p>
  <p>Oh dear. Perhaps a local would be able to offer an explanation?</p>
  <p>GAIN keyword CLOSED.</p>
  <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.push('closed')>>
  <ul class='choices'>
    <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
  </ul>
<<else>>
  <p>(Keyword CLOSED detected)</p>
  <p>The school is still dark. No one seems to be here.</p>
  <p>You'll have to return once it has re-opened.</p>
  <ul class='choices'>
    <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
  </ul>
<</if>>

:: hank
<p>Oh, hey there! Don’t worry, I’m not here to swipe anything. You just have to be careful with this contraption—itll gobble your coins faster than a penguwaiian downs a pineapple.</p>
<p>So… what brings you to Little Moose?</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[I’m looking for Grace->hank: grace]]</li>
</ul>

:: hank: grace
<p>Hey, same here! But you’re a bit late—apparently we just missed her. There's a note on the door, if you haven't noticed already.</p>
<p>But...I could use a hand, if you don't mind. My legs are jelly from hiking here all the way from Raven Wing, and I still need to get these Mergiballs to Professor Tamarack in Cascade Village.</p>
<p>I’ll make it worth your while if you deliver them for me. Apparently the professor *never* leaves town. Something about being really, really busy with lots of things all the time.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[I’ll do it->hank: accept]]</li>
  <li>[[But I just came from there!->hank: lani]]</li>
</ul>

:: hank: accept
<p>Perfect! Here are the mergiballs. But watch your grip, they’re a bit bouncy.</p>
<p>I’ll keep sniffing around for clues about Grace’s whereabouts.</p>
<p>Safe travels!</p>
<p>GAIN keyword DELIVERY.</p>
  <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.push('delivery')>>
<ul class=’choices’>
  <li>[[Continue exploring->d6]]</li>
</ul>

:: hank: lani
<p>Ah, then you’ve probably met my old pal Lani. They work with Professor Tamarack now, studying at Pretty Rock Bay.</p>
<p>Tell ’em Hank says hi. And remind them they still owe me for fixing their “waterproof” recorder… the one that somehow got wet *inside* the waterproof case.</p> 
<p>Anyway, here are the mergiballs for delivery. Thanks for the help and safe travels!</p>
<p>GAIN keyword DELIVERY.</p>
  <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.push('delivery')>>
<ul class=’choices’>
  <li>[[Continue exploring->d6]]</li>
</ul>
